          <change when="2017-02-27T06:43:38-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/simoeis">Vote - AcceptText - I agree with Cowey. Note, though, that the encoding should be &lt;:δημοσιωνῶν=Chrest.Wilck. 275.8|ed|δημιοσιωνῶν.</change>
          <change when="2017-02-22T10:28:45-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/james.cowey">Vote - AcceptText - As is clear from the photo (Tafel IV) in ZPE 75 (1988), the reading is δημοσιωνῶν. P.Oxy. 1 44.8 does indeed print δημιοσιωνῶν. The first iota must be a simple typo. Chrest.Wilck. 275.8 printed δημοσιωνῶν without any comment. Thus I think we should encode &lt;:δημοσιωνῶν=Chrest.Wilck. 275.8|ed|δημοσιωνῶν:&gt;</change>
